WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.370
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.920
Okay. I'll show you. The real reason...

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.470
Well, now you know...

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:17.400
"'The Too-Painful Parting"'

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:25.370
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:31.480
At first I turned him down,
saying it would be mean to Momo-chan.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:37.010
But Toji was so passionate about it,
after a while, I just couldn't say no!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.160
Toji!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.160
You're late! I've been waiting for you.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.170
So where shall we go on our date today?

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.830
Anywhere you want
to go is fine, Kashiwagi.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:51.500
Oh, Toji, you always do what I want to do!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.830
What a loser.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:58.340
Never mind. She's just jealous.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.450
On to our next question.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.420
From the next five choices,

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:12.120
choose the word that best fits
the blank in the passage...

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.890
How could you, Toji?
Why are you doing this?

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.470
Well, now you know.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.470
Do you love Sae? Are you serious?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.840
l'm never going to believe that!!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.980
"'Read this!"'

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.930
Wait!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.500
You sure are persistent. I already told you.
I have no intention of making up with you.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.170
How can you talk about making up
when we haven't even broken up?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:02.830
I have no intention of
breaking up with you, Toji.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.870
You're becoming a nuisance.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:12.520
Stop following me around.
It upsets Kashiwagi.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.460
How could he?!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:26.470
We were madly in love until just recently.
But why? Why would you go out with Sae?

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:27.470
Anybody but Sae!

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:35.140
Breaking up is bad enough, but to
do it over Sae?! No way! No! No! No!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.810
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.480
That was the voice coming
from your heart, Momo-chan.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:40.910
Oops, are you mad?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.050
Huh? You're not gonna get mad?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.820
Or you're so disgusted that
you don't even have the energy?

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.550
But you're totally right...
what you just said.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:57.500
Dump him, just dump him!
That heartless guy!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.160
Don't talk bad about Toji!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:05.440
Sae must have something on Toji.
Otherwise, Toji would never act like that!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.770
You really believe in Toji, don't you?

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:10.780
Of course!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:15.650
The relationship we've built together
can't be broken that easily.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.480
Enough already!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.820
But even so... I believe in you, Toji.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.470
You're still waiting?

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:39.870
Just stop already. Can't you
see that it's bothering Toji?

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.470
You've got some nerve.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:47.150
I bet you found something to blackmail Toji
with and forced him to breakup with me.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.480
What are you talking about?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.480
Are you stupid?!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.090
If Toji really loved you, Momo-chan,

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:58.160
then don't you think he would
ignore whatever I say?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.760
But he's not doing that because
he's really over you, Momo-chan.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.760
Not only that, he said
you're becoming a nuisance.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.100
He said he felt sorry
for you at first but lately,

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:11.770
you're so persistent that
it's just getting annoying.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:14.600
He said it's creepy how
you're acting like a stalker.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:22.110
Poor, Momo-chan. I feel bad
for you, so I'll tell you something.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.780
Toji already left out of the back gate.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.990
Well? Are you still going to go after Toji,

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.890
even when he's trying
this hard to avoid you?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.790
Wow, she's fast.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.800
No way! Toji would never say anything
like that. She's just lying again!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.470
"'Tojigamori"'

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:40.790
But...

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.470
What do you want?

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.470
Uh... um...

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.470
Well, if there's nothing...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.140
W- wait!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.110
I don't know what Sae said to you,

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:58.150
but I can go through anything
as long as I'm with you, Toji.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:04.090
I can withstand anything! So please
don't try to go through this alone. Toji!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.750
Toji! Toji!

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:45.690
lt's so cold... but l have
to make Toji understand...

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:56.000
l can get through anything.
l'll get stronger... So please, Toji...

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.090
Go home.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:11.090
The neighbors are going to start
talking if you stay here any longer.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.760
Oh yeah...

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:17.430
While you're at it, throw these away.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:21.100
These are... from my birthday party...

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.160
I don't need 'em anymore.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.840
Oh yeah, and this too...

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.110
Sorry, it slipped out of my hand.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.780
How could you?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.790
How is this read?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.450
Amour de Patou.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.450
"'Amour"' means "'love,"' right?

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:54.130
This was your first gift to me,
Toji... It was our precious memory!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.760
We don't need it anymore.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.400
Wait!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.750
I can't! No! I can't go on without you, Toji!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.750
I don't wanna break up! I don't want to!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.010
Toji!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.150
Toji! Toji!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.420
No! No!

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:24.190
Toji! Toji! Toji!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:42.780
I hear Momo-chan's absent today.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:46.720
Apparently, she caught a cold
crying all night in the snow,

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.740
outside someone's house.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.790
Hang on!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.130
Have you lost your mind?

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.060
Not as much as you.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:04.470
All Momo-chan did was believe in you, Toji,

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:08.140
and this is the way you treat her?
Are you really that much of a scumbag?

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:10.140
How dare you...

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.470
...say that to me!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.870
You bastard!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.750
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.820
My goodness! What's wrong with you two?

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.490
Too much testosterone?!

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.830
Ouch!

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:32.290
Okay, I'm done with you. Now, get out! Go!

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.500
What happened? Why were you fighting?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:40.170
Was Okayasu-kun trying
to hit on Adachi-san again?

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:44.340
But then again, you look more
beaten up than he did, Tojigamori-kun.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.850
Come to think of it,
Adachi-san is absent today,

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:47.110
isn't she?

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:50.550
"'Absentees"'
"'1-1 Sakamoto"'
"'1-3 Adachi Koyama"'

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:51.520
in the faculty lounge.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.520
Does she have a cold?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:56.190
I'm not surprised,
it was pretty cold yesterday.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.190
I... kept her out.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:05.460
She came to my house, but I left her
outside in the snow for many hours.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:09.800
No wonder she got sick!
Why would you do something like that?

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:12.140
She's such a fool...

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:14.470
No matter how many times I push her away,

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:17.810
she still believes in me, and comes back,
like some abandoned puppy.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:20.850
Even when I throw rocks
to shoo them away,

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.820
they're still there when I turn around.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:28.490
They may be all beaten up
but still they keep coming back...

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:32.490
I didn't want to hurt her like that.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:36.890
Why did I... have to break up
with her like that?

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.330
But...

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:45.770
I had no choice...

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:53.600
This was the only way to protect Adachi...

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:16.470
Toji... Toji... Why?

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:19.470
We don't need it anymore.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:25.970
Toji... Are we really over?
What did l do wrong?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.970
Huh? Toji?

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.490
Shut up, you stupid dog.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.150
Geez, shut up!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:39.490
How long have you been here?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.690
Not long. I was just in the area, so I...

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.620
Momo? What are you doing?

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:09.320
--Going out like that with a fever!
--Why would Toji be here? Stupid me...

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.120
Oh man...

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:16.750
P.E. is such a drag! I don't wanna go.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.220
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.470
I have a headache.
May I lie down for a while?

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.140
Okay, shall we check your temperature?

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.500
All right.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.140
Kashiwagi-san...

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.480
There's something I wanted to ask you.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.150
Ask me?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:42.150
Where are the photos? The photos
of Adachi-san and that model together.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:44.160
You have them, don't you?

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.490
What are you talking about?

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:49.030
Tojigamori-kun told me about it.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.500
You told him if he didn't
break up with Adachi-san,

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:53.160
then you'd send those pictures
out to the mass media.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.900
I... I never said anything like that!

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.440
I swear...

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:05.440
Do you have any idea what Tojigamori-kun
went through to break up with Adachi-san?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:10.120
You took advantage of
Tojigamori-kun's feelings for Adachi-san.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:14.450
What's the point of going out
with him after doing all that?

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.120
But...

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:21.130
Doctor, do you really think
I would do something like that?

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:25.800
You only listen to Toji's side of
the story without even asking for mine...

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:29.600
How awful... that's just awful...

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.130
Stop that fake crying.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.770
You have proof?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.540
You have any proof that I did that?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.820
That old hag is so annoying!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.490
Why did you have to go and tell her?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.490
You know what'll happen
if you tick me off, right?

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:59.450
I hold the trump card, you know.
Don't waste your time trying to fight it.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.430
You belong to me...

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:17.120
We can't come to the phone right now.
Please leave a message after the beep.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:20.120
A... Adachi? This is Kako.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:23.120
How are you feeling?
Come back to school soon, okay?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:27.060
We're all worried about you.
I'll talk to you soon.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.560
l've been absent for a week now.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:35.470
My fever's gone down...

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.960
...but why won't my tears stop?

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.470
Toji...

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:47.150
l'm such an idiot... Even after
all this, l still have hope...

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:51.150
After all, Toji,
you've never disappointed me...

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:56.350
When l was crying, you always
came to my rescue... Right, Toji?

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:04.490
Momo-chan! Let's go on a date! A date!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.770
Momo-chan!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.430
You're here again?

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:15.110
I told you that I'll come every day
until you get better. Oh, look that face.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:19.780
You've been crying again. You can't
stay in the house crying all the time.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.780
I bet your fever's gone down
a long time ago.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:23.450
But...

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.780
Come on, come on!

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:28.450
You need to get out
and breathe some fresh air!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.460
Hey, stop! I'm in my pajamas!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.180
Never mind, don't worry.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:39.530
Oh boy, what a beautiful day!
Don't you think, Momo-chan?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.730
Shall we go on a boat or something?

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.670
"'Crepes"' "'Takoyaki"'

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.130
Hey, food stands! You want something?
My treat!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.450
Come on, let's have some takoyaki!
Takoyaki!

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:03.980
How about a baked sweet potato!
It's good for you, and it'll keep you warm!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.430
Then how about a kiss?

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.220
Cut it out!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.730
Yup, being angry is definitely
more you than crying, Momo-chan.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.930
Right, Momo-chan?

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:32.120
Why did he dump me?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:36.450
Do you think Toji really
fell in love with Sae?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.790
I don't know. I'm not Toji after all...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:44.130
I guess Sae's more attractive than I am.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:47.800
Don't be silly.
You're totally attractive, Momo-chan!

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.130
Stop. Don't try to make me feel better.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.140
What? You mean you don't believe me?

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.800
No, I don't.

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:03.340
Well, in that case...
I'll have to prove it.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.090
Hey, this store's great.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.750
Or do you like this boutique?

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.090
Either one is fine, but...

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.760
Wow, this is cute.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:13.760
You think?

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:15.760
Let's see... not this one...

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:18.100
--How about this one?
--Yeah! That's perfect for you, Momo-chan!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:19.430
You think so?

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.770
Hey, this is cute too.

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:24.770
Excuse me, can she try this on?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.440
Wait!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:27.110
Don't worry.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:29.770
What are you thinking, bringing me here?

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.110
Chill out.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.080
It doesn't cost a penny to try it on.
Come on, we're here!

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:40.120
You ready?

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.790
Uh-huh.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.790
Wow!

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:45.790
Bravo!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.490
It looks great on you.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.460
Okay, let's go to the next store. Next!

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:52.130
W- wait...

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.800
Hang on, I have to take this off.

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.130
That's okay. I already paid for it.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.140
What?!

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:59.800
Look, check this out.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.410
This will look great on you, Momo-chan.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:06.410
Wait a minute, Okayasu. What do
you mean, you already paid for it?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.400
Oh, don't worry about it. I'm loaded today.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.750
Check this out.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.090
My brother got some
extra cash from a side job.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:18.090
I asked him to treat me and he gave me
this to use at my discretion.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.430
Yeah, but you don't have to do this...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.430
Don't worry.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:26.830
It's a gift. I want to do this for you.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.230
Well...

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.440
l guess...

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.350
...it's okay...

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.790
Wow!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:00.470
How cute, Momo-chan!
You're so cute! Gorgeous!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:02.470
You're stunning!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.470
Okay, that's enough.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:11.480
But you're really cute. The best!
Pretty! Cute! Charismatic!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.480
Stupid.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.740
I'll take your smile over a frown any day!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.150
See? Everyone's checking you out,
Momo-chan.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.790
Didn't I tell you? Momo-chan,
you're attractive,

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:28.160
so you shouldn't put yourself down.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:33.830
Okayasu... The money for all the clothes...
I'll pay you back, okay?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.170
But why? They're presents.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.840
I can't let you do that.
There's no reason for you to.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:42.840
I'm broke now... but I'll pay you back
with the money I'll get at New Year's.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.510
You sure are stubborn, Momo-chan.
It's just like you.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:46.510
Well...

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:50.520
All right, all right. Do whatever
makes you happy, Momo-chan.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.910
Okay...

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.180
I'm home!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:06.800
How cute, Momo-chan! You're so cute!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:10.230
Even if my girl friends said that to me,

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:13.810
l don't know if l would have
taken it to heart like this.

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:17.100
l didn't think l was ready to laugh again.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.940
l guess l'm glad he took me out today...

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:44.530
Hey, Momo-chan?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:49.710
How did you know I was here?

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:52.840
There's something I forgot
to tell you, Momo-chan.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:57.680
Come to school tomorrow, okay?
I know it's hard, but don't run away.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.410
Toji's never coming back... again...

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:12.250
No matter how long l wait,
Toji's never coming back again...

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:18.460
We're really...

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:27.740
...over.

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:42.730
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:52.400
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:55.410
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.410 --> 00:23:02.010
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:08.350
Where can we go

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:18.030
where we can all be

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:20.700
under the same sky?

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:29.040
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:35.710
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:42.050
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:49.390
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:57.490
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.670 --> 00:24:04.340
lt's unfair. lt seems like every time
l'm feeling vulnerable,

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:06.340
you're there being nice to me.

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:11.350
Have l fallen for Okayasu?
What should l do?

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:14.680
Next time on Peach Girl,
''The Peach Flower, Blossomed?''
